	(descr "Xinyangze YZ103915020T-04025-02 (JLC/LCSC C6276862): 4-pin SMT magnetic pogo receptacle, flat contacts at 2.54 mm. From the maker's drawing (2015-07-08): body 22.30 x 7.70 mm stadium, 2.00 tall on feet 0.20 below it (2.20 mounted); recommended land 4 x 2.20 mm round pads at 2.54; two NdFeB magnets in its ends (at +-7.62, the copper under them kept bare: they are bare metal on the board); two 5.00 x 1.50 x 0.50 mm locating bosses on its underside, centred on each long side: here 5.40 x 1.90 mm slots, taken flush with the long edges (the drawing does not dimension that; check a sample). Origin = body centre; pad 1 at -X.")
